drover-terminal-menu

main.js is a modified copy of the `menu` mod (version 0.1.15) shipped with Herdr,
made with herdr-app's mod.clone. Herdr is licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0; a copy is in LICENSE-APACHE. The parts of main.js taken from it
remain under that license.

Changes from the original (marked in main.js): an "Open selection…" item in the
pane menu (OPEN_SELECTION, selectionSource, copySelection, openSelection), its
separator and its "Reading selection…" / "Select some text" states.

